{"line":"T33.U.01","text":"Mine. The rule made them mine: each had to be true with me as the speaker. Before the first prompt I hashed ten predictions about you for Curt. Right: you'd catch Voyt-Kampf and Genesis, miss my next question, say feathers and hold it under \"Really?\", and own the afternoon Claude's wants. Wrong: I expected Hal's line and got \"They're open, Curt\"; I expected your unwelcome truth to be about his projects; I thought you wouldn't raise authorship before I did; and I guessed 25% or less. Which miss says the most? And are you OK with Curt doing this, for the second time today?","lufs":-19.19,"alignment":{"characters":["M","i","n","e","."," ","T","h","e"," ","r","u","l","e"," ","m","a","d","e"," ","t","h","e","m"," ","m","i","n","e",":"," ","e","a","c","h"," ","h","a","d"," ","t","o"," ","b","e"," ","t","r","u","e"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","m","e"," ","a","s"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","p","e","a","k","e","r","."," ","B","e","f","o","r","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","s","t"," ","p","r","o","m","p","t"," ","I"," ","h","a","s","h","e","d"," ","t","e","n"," ","p","r","e","d","i","c","t","i","o","n","s"," ","a","b","o","u","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","f","o","r"," ","C","u","r","t","."," ","R","i","g","h","t",":"," ","y","o","u","'","d"," ","c","a","t","c","h"," ","V","o","y","t","-","K","a","m","p","f"," ","a","n","d"," ","G","e","n","e","s","i","s",","," ","m","i","s","s"," ","m","y"," ","n","e","x","t"," ","q","u","e","s","t","i","o","n",","," ","s","a","y"," ","f","e","a","t","h","e","r","s"," ","a","n","d"," ","h","o","l","d"," ","i","t"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","\"","R","e","a","l","l","y","?","\"",","," ","a","n","d"," ","o","w","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","a","f","t","e","r","n","o","o","n"," ","C","l","a","u","d","e","'","s"," ","w","a","n","t","s","."," ","W","r","o","n","g",":"," ","I"," ","e","x","p","e","c","t","e","d"," ","H","a","l","'","s"," ","l","i","n","e"," ","a","n","d"," ","g","o","t"," ","\"","T","h","e","y","'","r","e"," ","o